{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2019-11-05 22:30:00', 'title': 'MODERNA, INC. REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER AND NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019', 'text': 'MODERNA, INC. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER AND NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 17.046 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 41.757 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING LOSS WAS USD 130.857 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 85.818 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET LOSS WAS USD 123.194 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 80.331 MILLION A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 46.154 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 99.647 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING LOSS WAS USD 416.626 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 260.235 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET LOSS WAS USD 390.905 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 243.308 MILLION A YEAR AGO.'}